# Hyphens

Write compound titles and asides with ASCII hyphen-minus `-`.

```
# Good
# Time to Kill - native PC recompilation
**Accepted - do not touch.**

# Bad
# Unicode em dash or en dash between words
```

Do not insert U+2014 or U+2013. Replace them with `-`.
